        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TH1100-HK1 Full Surface Deluxe Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeluxe full surface hinge kit.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeluxe Hinge Kits are the ideal choice for multiple application door solutions, when existing hardware fails. Perfect repair solution for metal framed store front doors when the existing pivot hinges fail and the frame is damaged.  A quick and easy fix for any compromised opening. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-prodigy-finish.jpg?v=1704354506\" width=\"450\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Global TH1100-HK1 hinge size diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Installation:</b> The properly installed upper hinge has an adjustment screw facing the top. The lower hinge has an adjustment screw facing bottom. Mount hinge on door and frame, then drill (6) six pilot holes for one way screws. For flush door and frame installation use the shim provided on the door jamb. Or for 1/8\" offset door installation,  no shim is required. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Just a few uses for these hinges would be:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Storefronts / Security Entrances</li>\r\n<li>Vaults / Safes</li>\r\n<li>Audio Rooms / Cold Rooms</li>\r\n<li>Refrigerators / Freezers</li>\r\n<li>Truck Bodies / Trailers</li>\r\n<li>Hatches / Hoppers / Utility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For commercial doors up to 500 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Non handed full surface applications</li>\r\n<li>Made from high-tensile aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Self-lubricating pin rotates on anti-friction bearings</li>\r\n<li>Hinges securely fastened with tamper proof screws</li>\r\n<li>Vertical adjustment screw</li>\r\n<li>Weather resistant</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Doors easily serviced without removal of hinge pin</li> -->\r\n<li>Lift off type pins</li>\r\n<li>Pin Diameter:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packed and sold in pairs</li>\r\n<li>Available in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finishes</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GLO-TH100-HK1-instructions.pdf?v=1704262222\" target=\"new\"><b>TH100-HK1 Instruction Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Deluxe Hinge Kit contains:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> (2) roto pin hinges</li>\r\n<li>(12) one-way screws</li>\r\n<li>(4) cover strips</li>\r\n<li>(1) Allen wrench for vertical adjustment</li>\r\n<li>(2) 1/8\" shims for flush door application</li>\r\n<!-- <li> (1) Instruction sheet</li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a PAIR (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
